# Bun HTTP API services that share the canonical single-stage Dockerfile
# (templates/Dockerfile.bun-api) and .dockerignore (templates/dockerignore).
#
# `scripts/apply-service-template.sh` stamps the template into each sibling repo
# below, substituting __PORT__ with the port here. One source of truth for the
# otherwise-identical Dockerfiles.
#
# Intentionally NOT listed (justified structural differences — do not template):
#   screenwriter_api        health at /api/v1/health + longer start-period (initDatabase at boot)
#   svgr_api                vtracer stage + OCR/Paddle/tesseract/fonts runtime
#   haraka-plugin-wildduck  node-alpine, clones Haraka, npm, tini
#   heavymath_indexer       ponder indexer: alpine + ponder user + codegen (own pair)
#   mail_box_indexer        ponder indexer: alpine + ponder user + codegen (own pair)
#   sudojo_bot              3-stage build with a bun build step
#
# repo                  port
shapeshyft_api          8020
shaperouter_api         8020
tapayoka_api            8025
whisperly_api           8021
mixr_api                6174
mogulgame_api           8029
raidr_agent_api         8038
raidr_mcp_api           8040
webgraph_api            8033
music_api               8032
raidr_api               8037
sudojo_api              8010
sudobility_api          8040
